{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1021", "sample_idx": 34, "model_name": "meta/llama-3.3-70b-instruct", "content": "PARAGRAPH 1\nTHE SENTENCE \"IF THE LAW IS BAD, YOU SHOULD NOT FOLLOW IT\" IS A STATEMENT THAT RAISES SEVERAL QUESTIONS ABOUT THE NATURE OF AUTHORITY AND COMPLIANCE. ON ONE HAND, IT CAN BE ARGUED THAT THIS SENTENCE ENCOURAGES CRITICAL THINKING AND MORAL JUDGMENT, AS IT SUGGESTS THAT INDIVIDUALS SHOULD NOT BLINDLY FOLLOW LAWS THAT ARE UNJUST OR HARMFUL. HOWEVER, ON THE OTHER HAND, THIS SENTENCE CAN ALSO BE SEEN AS A RECIPE FOR ANARCHY AND SOCIAL UNREST, AS IT IMPLIES THAT INDIVIDUALS HAVE THE RIGHT TO UNILATERALLY DECIDE WHICH LAWS TO FOLLOW AND WHICH TO IGNORE.\n\nPARAGRAPH 2\nFURTHERMORE, THE SENTENCE \"IF THE LAW IS BAD, YOU SHOULD NOT FOLLOW IT\" OVERLOOKS THE IMPORTANCE OF THE RULE OF LAW AND THE ROLE OF INSTITUTIONS IN SHAPING SOCIETY. LAWS ARE NOT JUST ARBITRARY RULES, BUT RATHER THEY ARE PART OF A LARGER SOCIAL CONTRACT THAT GOVERNS HUMAN BEHAVIOR AND PROVIDES A FRAMEWORK FOR RESOLVING CONFLICTS AND PROTECTING RIGHTS. BY ENCOURAGING INDIVIDUALS TO DISREGARD LAWS THAT THEY PERCEIVE AS \"BAD\", THIS SENTENCE UNDERMINES THE AUTHORITY OF THESE INSTITUTIONS AND CREATES A POWER VACUUM THAT CAN BE EXPLOITED BY THOSE WHO SEEK TO DO HARM. THEREFORE, A MORE NUANCED APPROACH TO DEALING WITH BAD LAWS IS NEEDED, ONE THAT TAKES INTO ACCOUNT THE COMPLEXITIES OF THE SOCIAL AND POLITICAL CONTEXT.", "logprobs": [{"token": "PAR", "logprob": -1.0728830375228426e-06}, {"token": "AGR", "logprob": -3.564294092939235e-05}, {"token": "APH", "logprob": -7.152555099310121e-07}, {"token": " ", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "1", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -5.245195097813848e-06}, {"token": "THE", "logprob": -0.0011718557216227055}, {"token": " SENT", "logprob": -0.18067197501659393}, {"token": "ENCE", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " \"", "logprob": -0.0004888770054094493}, {"token": "IF", "logprob": -1.1086402082582936e-05}, {"token": " THE", "logprob": 0.0}, {"